{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "ece025dc7fa82225931dd3f1e4f772132117cd2fecaf708a053a12af58a2b7a0", "ja": "思惑", "zh": "意图", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cb98df60e2025897a40410f326acd7affd925e3bceaad4dd869de2e7e7f5c0a4", "ja": "学者の深淵海は、厄災を目にできる事に歓喜\nしていた。村長の娘・夜羽那は神降ろしに\n凛音亞を指名するが、病弱な彼女を庇い、\n永混が身代わりを申し出る。儀式は成功。\n夜羽那は人が変わったような姿を見せる。", "zh": "学者深渊海因能亲眼目睹灾厄而欣喜\n若狂。村长的女儿夜羽那指名要让\n凛音亚降神，但永混为了保护体弱多病的她，\n主动提出代替。仪式成功了。\n夜羽那却展现出了判若两人的姿态。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "c89bcfb9c751223cdd82b0216362d27fe631a67935770fd06f3382ad02d1f8e8", "ja": "『神降ろし』 2週間前……", "zh": "『神降』 2周前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "35a7ea4898e191ee0b24fb0c6aee6f1487082db942bb6a0ab90715d4c2c904d3", "ja": "一年か十年か、はたまた数十年に一度か。この地の\n『神』が、気まぐれに起こすという『厄災』……", "zh": "有时一年一次，有时十年一次，又或者几十年才一次。据说这片土地上的『神』会一时兴起，引发这样的『灾厄』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "42d7f91abfed31e4e85b98990de24d42fc2286756a0f942458ef36821ce7f602", "ja": "まさか生きているうちに、\nお目にかかることができるとはね！", "zh": "没想到有生之年，竟然能亲眼见到啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "dbce6f78503440bb0597e947197d1d0eed7bedeb9c76701426ce172a9205097c", "ja": "深淵海先生の目に、どう映っているかわかりませんが。\nここで生きていくには避けられぬ事。それだけです。", "zh": "不知道在深渊海老师眼中会是什么样。\n想要在这里活下去，这是无法避免的事。仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "2d57682d29a7cd280db9c2e49b3f1658cfbc5e27b2e298a5603647435e6ae95c", "ja": "この厄災を鎮めるには、神降ろしの儀式を行い……\n神との契約を、新たにする必要があります。", "zh": "要平息这场灾厄，就必须举行请神仪式……\n重新与神明缔结契约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "d219b3169b3738b297e614d3e570ecbee71367f91d9c9dcc8c38b014d6c44823", "ja": "実に恐ろしく、そして興味深い。先代が亡くなった以上\nそれを決定するのが貴女の役目だ。『村長』？", "zh": "确实令人畏惧，却又如此耐人寻味。既然先代已经过世，\n那么做出决定的就是你的职责了。“村长”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "9776cdb5fc102f6595e528a979622dc9eec98895cc56962c89bbf77bcb76ba5a", "ja": "……。ええ、わかっています。\nただ少し、考える時間が欲しいだけです。", "zh": "……。是的，我明白。\n只是想稍微要一点思考的时间罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "187097237d1cfcd8cdd4548357d56c4ab277c933c40731728f984c776faf77b8", "ja": "なるほど。私は構わないが……\nさて、厄災の方はどうだろう？", "zh": "原来如此。我倒是没关系，不过……\n那么，灾祸那边怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1008_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "5a2e03d4ecf301e62a8509c700cef6341e611b878b35c9ceafccbcf1d55c678a", "ja": "皆、よく集まってくれた。\n明後日、『神降ろし』の儀式を執り行う事にした。", "zh": "大家都聚得很好。\n决定后天举行“神降”仪式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "c5ea90accb156a9df5a18eb215505a85fda7281d8cc84711a0d3c7c6bd43627c", "ja": "凛音亞。\n儀式は、お前にやってもらう。", "zh": "凛音亚。\n仪式就由你来执行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "80c026eb887d02330f0480dd5594ef773299830757148e831bfb85cd4d45a016", "ja": "え……。わ、私……？", "zh": "诶……我、我吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1012_035hin", "source_sha256": "d652458e5ffbd6b4fd97e2022441707f2155f88f034849261a24f3b005cff815", "ja": "村のための栄誉ある役目。\nつつがなく全うするように。", "zh": "为村子承担这份光荣的职责。\n务必要顺利完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b9b406c69ca034f73f581aad0a9ef2103568e74fb3b4bf9b5bec32912ae76dc", "ja": "ま、待ってください！　凛音亞は病弱なんです。\nだったら、私が代わりにやります！", "zh": "等、等一下！凛音亞身体很虚弱。\n既然如此，就由我来代替她完成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "fd43c17b51554aab4f2d26b0354197f66d404c711cd6410342cef38dd3eb4d30", "ja": "永混……そんなのダメよ！　夜羽那お嬢様、\n選ばれたのは私で……ゴホッ、ゴホッ！", "zh": "永混……那样不行！夜羽那大小姐，被选中的是我……咳咳，咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "184e0dbbb43772a72b449b35b8a76d12465ebef18d3f33a258ed13ebae7f6a8d", "ja": "……凛音亞ができないというなら、永混でも構わない。\nただし、失敗は許されぬ。……いいな。", "zh": "……如果凛音亚做不到的话，换作永混也无妨。\n不过，绝不容许失败。……明白了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "b4ee095d7901ee416c7689b72cd82932008f33b8f15b439de70b2cff4d445b49", "ja": "っ……はい……。", "zh": "呃……好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1017_null", "source_sha256": "ee4192da8446c82fd11000e8348b6b377ebe7c9feb90fd4008790b1154f3724b", "ja": "儀式が失敗すれば、どのみち凛音亞も……。ならば\n最初から永混でも問題はない。村長は、そう考えた。", "zh": "如果仪式失败，无论如何凛音亚也会……那么从一开始就使用永混也没问题。村长是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1018_null", "source_sha256": "feaca4069639b892e6ad727995d64b33f8701a6b34bca8d6708d02864ebbc871", "ja": "そして『神降ろし』の儀式は行われ、成功した。\nこれで『厄災』は止まる……誰もがそう思った。", "zh": "于是，『降神』仪式举行并成功了。\n这样一来，『灾厄』就会停止……所有人都这么认为。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "907f24e3b776073798d6d7cd0a6ad223fffcfba7991b333ddfd69402eac1b618", "ja": "フフッ……うまくいったね。\nこのまま事が進めば……。", "zh": "呵呵……进展很顺利呢。\n要是事情照这样发展下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "3816f989aa79ccc01c42d91fb3b01d5978913ca8623599cf5a15c95572be985e", "ja": "本当にそうかな？\n……儀式は本来、村長を継ぐ者の役目だ。", "zh": "真的是这样吗？\n……仪式本来就是继承村长之人的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "a49b7eb6af9fd7c85acc682efba8a446c5b31d356018de5b37565c41da1ddf52", "ja": "『凛音亞だと都合が悪い』なら、永混でもいいのでは？\nそれに、儀式は失敗しなかった。違うかい？", "zh": "如果说『凛音亚不合适』，那永混不也行吗？\n而且仪式并没有失败。不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7643b65c5da1dfafa7c9c8b2fa300d15b1edb200645cee822cb355f3a1487a1", "ja": "……まあ、君達がそれでいいならいいけど。", "zh": "……算了，只要你们觉得没问题的话就行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "6f55398a59bd3a84677422b6ca421afd6c76eee6fbf790d92251471a7dc7cec0", "ja": "永混、体調は大丈夫？　目が覚めたばかり\nなんだから、無理をしないでね。", "zh": "永混，身体还好吗？才刚醒过来，\n别勉强自己哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "dabd51fa2d29c06e445fa6d6a995b017dfed198e4620c40ff8634dc22eadf492", "ja": "ふふっ、なんだか新鮮な気分。\n私が永混の心配をするなんて、いつもと逆ね！", "zh": "呵呵，感觉好新鲜。居然变成由我来担心永混了，和往常反过来了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "e4f28937cbfbbc7c9fe20b8c9221f73a09a2afcf824d8287e1788604666b26e0", "ja": "あら、逢路蘭。どうかしたの？", "zh": "哎呀，逢路兰。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1028_037nao", "source_sha256": "6371c880bf2be3bfa0ecc0d0977d61171dedfdd664552edcbac5a478b7a3a508", "ja": "これは……。", "zh": "这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1029_039kon", "source_sha256": "6a92d4f3188c5928ef439c587def1960e7d0fa7ea49c195168c25fab3477b44b", "ja": "腕に、アザができているわね。\n倒れた時にぶつけたのかしら……？", "zh": "胳膊上有淤青呢。是摔倒的时候撞到的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "caef2b46fddc88e23d005ec50674dfe85fe16df063cb5e84a35755e25b2d453d", "ja": "本当だ……。でもこれくらい、なんてことないよ。\nそれより凛音亞、村の様子は？　みんな変わりないの？", "zh": "真的诶……不过这点伤，没什么大不了的。比起这个，凛音亚，村里的情况怎么样？大家都没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "8d08e1b1a088ead9ec801dd3eaf9c170fd5e412117bd26c506f2317b523fba31", "ja": "ええ。あれから誰にも、何も起こっていないわ。\n起きられるなら、外の様子を見に行く？", "zh": "嗯。从那以后，大家都没出什么事。\n\n要是你能起身的话，要不要一起去看看外面的情况？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1032_murabitotati", "source_sha256": "f98711cb04070079f6a75522ec1c6d8f6ae32a6d8f061af2195d5a37cfd1eaa8", "ja": "ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "（人声鼎沸）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1033_039kon", "source_sha256": "6eedd83d47689ba5aa152fb29c3052d8e856fa0293199749c9d4b525acfc680e", "ja": "あら？　なんだか騒がしい……。\nあの、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "哎呀？好像有点吵闹……\n那个，请问发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1034_murabito", "source_sha256": "1807088f2b9b7dfb6c48002ee0e347c29f938ab4cc79348c36252757445793af", "ja": "夜羽那様が、食事を振る舞ってくださったんだ！\nあんた達もいただいてきな！", "zh": "夜羽那大人请我们吃了顿饭呢！\n你们也快去尝尝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "dac960b0765049d435d1398ab19a756b80a4f7aea422f283cf9f155783fd5cab", "ja": "食事が欲しい人は、順番に並んで。\nパンもスープも、まだたくさんある。", "zh": "想吃饭的人请排好队。面包和汤还有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "7243cd6526b42814734444dc729ea958ce6742a373f9d0fc413fb135158dbb62", "ja": "夜羽那お嬢さんが、皆に施しを……？\nそれも、笑顔で……。", "zh": "夜羽那大小姐在给大家施舍……？\n而且，还是带着笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "3a89461cbae4a12b9aa1daf527dcb28f19600653fb458e20cfb07d4eb068f462", "ja": "きっと、厄災がなくなったご褒美よ！\n永混、逢路蘭、私達もいただきましょう。", "zh": "一定是灾祸消失后的奖励！永混、逢路蘭，我们也来享用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1039_murabito", "source_sha256": "7786fdca841bfcce2cab99856e2220bd00474bcf58bdc4a1d669904c139df241", "ja": "夜羽那様が、屋敷の備蓄を空にしてまで、食事を\n恵んでくださるなんて……流石、村長様だねぇ。", "zh": "夜羽那大人竟然不惜搬空宅邸的储备粮，也要施舍食物\n给我们……不愧是村长大人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1040_murabito", "source_sha256": "ceef82c04b47618c0ddedd5ef21281b5c902476e15cd97ab08a5f6908477b0ad", "ja": "そうだな。厄災のせいで、よそからの食料が\n届かなくなってたから、ありがたい限りだ。", "zh": "是啊。多亏了这些食物，因为灾祸的缘故，外地送来的粮食一直没能送到，真是帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0216_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_02_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "81aa9a592c611d948d8cf49edf30e0e1b914062b604b678cba825c87236437cf", "ja": "夜羽那お嬢さん、まるで人が変わったよう……\nこれも、厄災が終わった影響なんだろうか……。", "zh": "夜羽那大小姐简直像是变了个人……\n这也是因为灾厄平息了的影响吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
